# Netlify Redirects File
# Simple redirect rules (alternative to netlify.toml redirects)
# Documentation: https://docs.netlify.com/routing/redirects/

# Redirect old intro page to new index
/intro.html   /index.html   301

# Redirect old index to home
/index-old.html   /home.html   301

# Handle 404 errors - redirect to home
/404.html   /home.html   404
